    "summary": "A needle case * / pin cushion made of patchwork.  Square in shape, and made from red and dark blue woollen cloth with nap (Five blue squares in middle; blue border.)  Lined with brown wool cloth (warp faced tabby).  Five pale blue glass (?) beads suspended from one corner, with wooden stick (with notches) at end.  (* No pocket) \r\n     Three large metal discs, with rough rims and with strung pale blue beads attached.  Unrelated to object?\r\n     Two needles [As1898,0702,45.b and c] attached.",
